      "content": "The yellowing, cloudiness, and spreading heat are signs that your burn is becoming infected, which is serious. Do not wrap it tightly, as this can restrict circulation and worsen the burn. You need to clean the area gently and cover it loosely with sterile dressing, but because of these signs, you absolutely must seek medical attention immediately. Ignoring spreading redness and infection risks a much bigger problem.",
